⭐ Interview Tip

The key insight is to compute each element's contribution instead of examining every subarray. For an element arr[i], count how many subarrays choose it as the minimum using Previous Smaller Element (PSE) and Next Smaller Element (NSE). Multiplying the number of left choices, right choices, and the element's value gives its total contribution. This reduces the solution from O(n²) to O(n).
